### v1.0.4 — Core Infrastructure

- [x] Single-pass atomic alias LDAP query replacing legacy iterative loops (reduces export time from 30+ min to seconds on large installations) (v1.0.4)
- [x] Universal LDAP URI resolver fallback via `zmlocalconfig`, `ldap_url`, and `ldap_master_url` (v1.0.4)
- [x] Anchored regex mailbox account filtering preventing false exclusions on legitimate usernames (v1.0.4)
- [x] Portable in-place file replacement `portable_replace()` for cross-platform GNU/BSD compatibility (v1.0.4)
- [x] Progress-aware timestamped batch mailbox export and import script generation with error tracking counters (v1.0.4)
- [x] Mailbox size reporting utility `util/mailbox_size.sh` with dynamic unit scaling (Bytes/KB/MB/GB/TB) (v1.0.4)
- [x] Email forwarding audit utility `util/audit_forwards.sh` covering both admin and webmail forwarding rules (v1.0.4)
- [x] Shared folders and calendar permissions audit utility `util/audit_shares.sh` (v1.0.4)
- [x] Domain disclaimer injection utility `util/add_disclaimer.sh` per-domain via `zimbraAmavisDomainDisclaimerText` (v1.0.4)
- [x] Dedicated session audit logging with timestamped log files per export session (v1.0.4)
- [x] Automated domain export via `DOMINIOS.ldif` and companion script `create_domains.sh` for target provisioning (v1.0.4)
- [x] Flexible mailbox export filters: all accounts, active-only, or per-domain (v1.0.4)
- [x] Global MTA configuration snapshot `CONFIG_GLOBAL.ldif` and `global_settings_snapshot.txt` (v1.0.4)
- [x] Immediate live mailbox export trigger option from within `z2z.sh` session (v1.0.4)

