## Pending Tasks (Release 1.0.7 Roadmap)

### Enterprise Core & Multi-Node Orchestration

- [ ] **[IDE-107-01] Multi-Server Cluster Topology Router**: Implement automated cluster discovery (`zmprov gas mailbox`) with per-mailbox-server batch routing (`-s <server>`) to query and stream accounts directly from their home storage node without overloading the master LDAP node.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-02] Carbonio Community Edition (CE) Compatibility Adapter**: Auto-detect Carbonio environment via biner `/opt/zextras/bin/carbonio` and adapt LDAP/provisioning syntax (`carbonio prov` / `carbonio admin`) for seamless cross-platform migration.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-03] Interactive TUI Wizard via `whiptail` / `dialog`**: Implement a guided Terminal UI dashboard for interactive phase selection (Domains, Accounts, Signatures, Sieve, OOO, Mailboxes) with automatic fallback to standard CLI text mode.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-04] Encrypted Transit & GPG Archive Shield**: Add optional AES-256-GCM / GPG symmetric encryption for exported mailbox `.tgz` bundles and LDAP dumps during transit over untrusted public WAN networks.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-05] ZCS 7.x & 8.0 Legacy Password & Schema Normalizer**: Add automated sanitization for legacy MD5/{CRYPT} password hashes and conversion of obsolete LDAP schema attributes when migrating from legacy ZCS 7/8 to Zimbra 10.1 (Daffodil).

### Cutover Automation & Performance Optimization

- [ ] **[IDE-107-06] Live Postfix Queue Drain & Transport Redirection**: Create `util/redirect_transport_maps.sh` to configure Postfix transport maps (`postmap /opt/zimbra/postfix/conf/transport`) for immediate mail forwarding to the new server IP during DNS MX propagation.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-07] Chunked Date-Range Archiving for Terabyte Mailboxes**: Implement automated time-sliced chunking (`query=before:YYYY/MM/DD` and `query=after:YYYY/MM/DD`) for monolithic mailboxes (> 100 GB) to prevent HTTP 504 gateway timeouts on slow storage backends.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-08] SSL/TLS Certificate & ACME/Let's Encrypt Migration**: Create `util/migrate_ssl_certs.sh` to snapshot commercial certificates (`zmcertmgr`) or automate DNS-01 ACME challenge issuance on the destination server.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-09] Custom Anti-Spam & Postscreen Policy Exporter**: Create `util/export_spam_rules.sh` to extract custom SpamAssassin rules, Postscreen whitelists, and MTA CIDR networks (`zimbraMtaMyNetworks`) from source to destination.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-10] Webhook Event Notification Engine**: Add configurable webhook alerting (Telegram, Slack, Discord, or generic JSON HTTP POST) triggered on batch stage completion, checkpoint resume, or failure thresholds.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-11] Pre-Flight Local DNS Resolver (Unbound/DNSDist) Optimizer**: Create `util/optimize_dns_resolver.sh` to validate and provision local caching DNS (Unbound/Bind9) on the destination server to prevent RBL query rate-limiting.
- [ ] **[IDE-107-12] Automated Disaster Rollback Engine**: Create `util/rollback_migration.sh` to safely revert target LDAP records and mailbox data back to a clean pre-migration baseline in case of maintenance window abort.
